<title>USA: TABLE - Westinghouse Air Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Westinghouse Air Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>WILMERDING, Pa. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q2		 SIX MONTHS</p>
<p>				    1997	 1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> NET SALES		   $138,066  $109,135 $274,574 $214,866</p>
<p> NET INCOME		     9,320     8,256   18,909   15,952</p>
<p> EARNINGS PER COMMON SHARE   0.37	0.29     0.71     0.56</p>
<p> WEIGHTED AVERAGE NUMBER OF SHARES</p>
<p>  OUTSTANDING		  24,924    28,410   26,719   28,446</p>
<p>	   (dollars in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Westinghouse Air Brake Co said sales benefited by $26.5 million from the acquisitions of Vapor Corp in September 1996 and Stone Safety in May 1997.</p>
<p>The company said it completed a repurchase of four million shares in March 1997.</p>
</text>
